0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 629.10 Td (The National Commercial Bank Jamaica Medical Platform is an internal web application for) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 614.93 Td (managing new-hire medical assessments. It replaces the manual process where a medical facility) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 600.75 Td (completes a paper form, scans it, and emails it to the National Commercial Bank Jamaica team.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 578.58 Td (The platform allows:) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 556.40 Td (" Reviewers to create doctor accounts and new-hire profiles.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 541.63 Td (" Doctors to select assigned new hires, complete the medical assessment, and submit the form) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 527.86 Td (securely.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 513.09 Td (" Reviewers to view, review, file/archive, and download submitted medical forms.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 498.32 Td (" Administrators to manage users, notification settings, and platform wording.) Tj ET
