0 0 0 rg BT /F3 7.8 Tf 54.00 415.40 Td (| Reviewer | National Commercial Bank Jamaica team member reviewing submitted forms | Create doctor accounts, create new-hire profiles, assign profiles to doctors, review submissions, download forms, track monthly doctor volumes |) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F3 7.8 Tf 54.00 405.65 Td (| Administrator | System administrator / HR platform owner | Manage users, roles, passwords, portal settings, notification emails, and all reviewer functions |) Tj ET
