0 0.356 0.667 rg BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 730.00 Td (11. Production Readiness Checklist) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 703.10 Td (Before live medical data is used:) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 680.93 Td (" Deploy behind HTTPS only.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 666.16 Td (" Set COOKIE_SECURE=true.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 651.39 Td (" Store APP_MASTER_KEY in a secure secret vault.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 636.62 Td (" Do not rely on data/master.key for production secrets.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 621.85 Td (" Restrict network access to approved users and facilities.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 607.08 Td (" Configure SMTP for real notifications.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 592.31 Td (" Create secure backups for the data/ directory.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 577.54 Td (" Test restore procedures.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 562.77 Td (" Define retention and deletion rules for candidate profiles and medical forms.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 548.00 Td (" Replace local user accounts with company SSO if required.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 533.23 Td (" Conduct privacy, legal, and information-security reviews.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 64.00 518.46 Td (" Run penetration/security testing before production rollout.) Tj ET
0 0.356 0.667 rg BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 491.69 Td (12. Operational Notes) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 464.79 Td (The application can be started with:) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F3 8.2 Tf 54.00 442.61 Td (node server.js) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 428.36 Td (For production, IT should run it as a managed service using systemd, PM2, Windows Service) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 414.19 Td (Manager, or an approved enterprise service manager.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 392.01 Td (The data/ directory must be treated as confidential because it contains encrypted medical) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 377.84 Td (records, application users, audit logs, and configuration.) Tj ET
0 0.356 0.667 rg BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 347.66 Td (13. Future Enhancements) Tj ET
